      "chapter": "global",
      "anchor": "global-hyperplane-level-line",
      "title": "The level bounds the labels for an orthogonal line projection",
      "hypotheses": "Fix a hyperplane and full integral intersection lattices P,Q in the hyperplane and its perpendicular line. A nonzero T kills the ambient dual quotient.",
      "statement": "The dual of qL lies between Q and T⁻¹Q. Rank-one lattice quotients are cyclic, so at most N((T)) labels are needed.",
